WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.850
the Memphis Police Department has fired all&nbsp;
five officers involved in the traffic stop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:09.710
arrest that may have led to the death of Tyree&nbsp;
Nichols the department said the five officers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:16.670
violated its policies pertaining to use of force&nbsp;
duty to render Aid and duty to intervene Memphis&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:21.770
Police said on January 7 Nichols tried to&nbsp;
run away on foot after officers pulled him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:26.390
over for reckless driving when he was eventually&nbsp;
caught and arrested he complained of shortness&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:31.370
of breath the 29 year old died three days&nbsp;
later in the hospital his family claims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:36.170
he was brutally beaten the police department&nbsp;
said it will release the arrest footage next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:41.510
week the FBI and justice department are also&nbsp;
launching an investigation into Nichols death

